{"id":"72010080dc80185b","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-hullopposite.md","title":"Unique opposite point of an implicant cube","display":"thm-hullopposite — Unique opposite point of an implicant cube","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-hullopposite","aliases":["27-thm-hullopposite"],"display":"thm-hullopposite — Unique opposite point of an implicant cube","depends_on":["[[27-df-pointhull]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_pdf_sha256":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f","source_section":"§3.2.1 Theorem 3.3","source_printed_pages":"128,129","source_pdf_pages":"152,153","verification_status":"source-statement-checked-and-proved-in-note","local_review_status":"formalization-audited-from-supplied-text; source-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-hullopposite"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-hullopposite</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-hullopposite — Unique opposite point of an implicant cube"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f81148ddb9a8ee2f\" href=\"?note=f81148ddb9a8ee2f\" title=\"27-df-pointhull\">27-df-pointhull</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_pdf_sha256","html":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§3.2.1 Theorem 3.3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"128,129"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"152,153"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked-and-proved-in-note"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formalization-audited-from-supplied-text; source-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,N\\subseteq[n]\">\\(P,N\\subseteq[n]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\cap N=\\varnothing\">\\(P\\cap N=\\varnothing\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(C:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 由下式构造。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;(C(a)\\le f(a))\">\\(\\forall a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;(C(a)\\le f(a))\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\">\\(y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C(y)=1\">\\(C(y)=1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hull}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Hull}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f81148ddb9a8ee2f\" href=\"?note=f81148ddb9a8ee2f\" title=\"27-df-pointhull\">27-df-pointhull</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C(a)\\coloneqq\\prod_{i\\in P}a_i\\prod_{j\\in N}(1-a_j)\\quad(a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C(a)\\coloneqq\\prod_{i\\in P}a_i\\prod_{j\\in N}(1-a_j)\\quad(a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"z_i\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}y_i,&amp;i\\in P\\cup N,\\\\1-y_i,&amp;i\\in[n]\\setminus(P\\cup N),\\end{cases}\\qquad z=(z_i)_{i=1}^n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[z_i\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}y_i,&amp;i\\in P\\cup N,\\\\1-y_i,&amp;i\\in[n]\\setminus(P\\cup N),\\end{cases}\\qquad z=(z_i)_{i=1}^n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C(z)=f(z)=1,\\qquad\\mathrm{Hull}_n(y,z)=C,\\qquad\\forall w\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;(\\mathrm{Hull}_n(y,w)=C\\Rightarrow w=z).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C(z)=f(z)=1,\\qquad\\mathrm{Hull}_n(y,z)=C,\\qquad\\forall w\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;(\\mathrm{Hull}_n(y,w)=C\\Rightarrow w=z).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>在项固定的坐标保留 y，在自由坐标反转它，即得同一子立方体中 y 的唯一对跖点。两点 hull 是否固定某坐标，精确记录两点在那里是否相等，因此不能有第二个对跖点。常一空项对应完全补向量；满项对应 z=y，这两端情形也成立。已逐项核对原书构造证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-pointhull","status":"resolved","id":"f81148ddb9a8ee2f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pointhull]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pointhull","status":"resolved","id":"f81148ddb9a8ee2f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}$，$P,N\\subseteq[n]$、$P\\cap N=\\varnothing$；$C:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}$ 由下式构造。$f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}$，$\\forall a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;(C(a)\\le f(a))$，$y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n$、$C(y)=1$；$\\mathrm{Hull}_n$ 见 [[27-df-pointhull]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"P,N\\subseteq[n]","display":false},{"tex":"P\\cap N=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"C:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;(C(a)\\le f(a))","display":false},{"tex":"y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n","display":false},{"tex":"C(y)=1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Hull}_n","display":false},{"tex":"C(a)\\coloneqq\\prod_{i\\in P}a_i\\prod_{j\\in N}(1-a_j)\\quad(a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n).","display":true},{"tex":"z_i\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}y_i,&i\\in P\\cup N,\\\\1-y_i,&i\\in[n]\\setminus(P\\cup N),\\end{cases}\\qquad z=(z_i)_{i=1}^n.","display":true},{"tex":"C(z)=f(z)=1,\\qquad\\mathrm{Hull}_n(y,z)=C,\\qquad\\forall w\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;(\\mathrm{Hull}_n(y,w)=C\\Rightarrow w=z).","display":true}],"bytes":1842,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-31","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-hullopposite|thm-hullopposite — Unique opposite point of an implicant cube]]"}],"outgoing":["f81148ddb9a8ee2f"]}